; Floats are IEEE 754 singles (microcode 2001; contract G1 sections 2.3, 2.4):
; DTP-SMALL-FLONUM's field is the binary32, arithmetic rounds to nearest, ties
; to even, a result past the largest single is an infinity, and ART-FLOAT holds
; one single a word.  Bits are compared as the field's integer (%POINTER).  The
; contract's checks: (+ 1.0 2.0), the rounding of 0.1, (float 16777217).
